WEBVTT

00:00:00.709 --> 00:00:06.442 line:85% position:50% align:center
A campus needs cables a preparation schedule and
a delivery route These are three

00:00:06.442 --> 00:00:11.793 line:85% position:50% align:center
different questions Before choosing an algorithm
decide what the answer must describe

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:15.747 line:85% position:50% align:center
an entire network an order or one path

00:00:26.042 --> 00:00:31.572 line:85% position:50% align:center
Vertices are numbered from zero A line connects
two vertices an arrow

00:00:31.572 --> 00:00:37.061 line:85% position:50% align:center
permits only its direction A weight gives the
cost Here original

00:00:37.061 --> 00:00:42.439 line:85% position:50% align:center
edge identifier one means the second input row
even after sorting

00:00:52.598 --> 00:00:57.843 line:85% position:50% align:center
An adjacency list gives each vertex its outgoing
connections An

00:00:57.843 --> 00:01:02.897 line:85% position:50% align:center
undirected edge needs entries at both ends with
the same original

00:01:02.897 --> 00:01:08.345 line:85% position:50% align:center
